<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Niyuta&apos;s Blog</title><description>I&apos;m not the only on here.</description><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/</link><item><title>DDPM Key Points</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/diffusion-model/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/diffusion-model/</guid><description>最近看到Imagen模型的论文，才发现原来都出自一人之手。看来有必要重温一下DDPM了</description><pubDate>Mon, 11 Aug 2025 15:06:17 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Score Matching</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/score-matching-%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%8E%A8%E5%AF%BC/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/score-matching-%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%8E%A8%E5%AF%BC/</guid><description>我觉得 [Score matching by Andy Jones](https://andrewcharlesjones.github.io/journal/21-score-matching.html) 说得挺清楚了，所以这一篇笔记主要是回忆性质，记下几个 key point 和 key idea。</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Jul 2025 05:07:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Singular Value Decomposition</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/singular-value-decomposition/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/singular-value-decomposition/</guid><description>奇异值分解就是把一个矩阵拆成*先旋转，再拉伸，再旋转*的线性变换。所以我们依然要从线性算子的视角看矩阵。</description><pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 12:49:43 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一致最大功效检验 UMP</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C-ump/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C-ump/</guid><description>一致最大功效检验 Uniform Most Powerful Test 是指在所有满足相同显著性水平 $\alpha$ 的检验中，对于备择假设空间 $H_1$ 中的每一个参数值，其功效都是最高的那个检验。</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 11:45:35 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>似然比检验</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E4%BC%BC%E7%84%B6%E6%AF%94%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E4%BC%BC%E7%84%B6%E6%AF%94%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C/</guid><description>其中临界值/显著性水平 $c \in [0, 1]$ ，检验定的拒绝域形式为 $\{ x : \lambda(x)\leq c \}$。</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Nov 2025 04:10:52 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>假设检验的评价</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%84%E4%BB%B7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E6%A3%80%E9%AA%8C%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%84%E4%BB%B7/</guid><description>假设检验是统计实验的内容，有个著名的故事叫 [女士品茶](https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A5%B3%E5%A3%AB%E5%93%81%E8%8C%B6)。</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Nov 2025 15:18:25 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>优雅地跳过失败的 Requirements 文件</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/pip-install-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E4%BC%98%E9%9B%85%E5%9C%B0%E8%B7%B3%E8%BF%87%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%E4%BE%9D%E8%B5%96/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/pip-install-%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E4%BC%98%E9%9B%85%E5%9C%B0%E8%B7%B3%E8%BF%87%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%E4%BE%9D%E8%B5%96/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 10:15:34 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>MCMC</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/mcmc-markov-chain-monte-carlo/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/mcmc-markov-chain-monte-carlo/</guid><description>各种常用的采样方法汇总</description><pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 10:58:25 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Flow Matching</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/flow-matching-%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/flow-matching-%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3/</guid><description>这个 flow-matching 网上的讲解似乎不止一个版本，李宏毅老师讲了一个基于反函数的 flow-matching (OpenAI GLOW, 2018) 算法。本篇的内容相较于 GLOW 是比较新的，基于论文 [\[2210.02747\] Flow Matching for Generative Modeli…</description><pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 12:47:16 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Torch DDP</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/torch-ddp/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/torch-ddp/</guid><description>首先是要搞清楚 `DataParallel` vs `DistributedDataParallel`。</description><pubDate>Mon, 24 Nov 2025 16:20:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>充分统计量</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E9%87%8F/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%85%85%E5%88%86%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>统计量：$(X_{1},X_{2},\dots,X_{n})$ 是样本，如果如果由此样本构造一个函数 $T(X_{1},X_{2},\dots,X_{n})$ 中**不含任何未知数**，那么它就是样本的统计量。常见的统计量*如样本的方差、均值*等。</description><pubDate>Sun, 28 Sep 2025 14:12:42 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>坐标系与位姿变换</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%8E%E4%BD%8D%E5%A7%BF%E5%8F%98%E6%8D%A2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%8E%E4%BD%8D%E5%A7%BF%E5%8F%98%E6%8D%A2/</guid><description>这一章相关内容在《机器人学导论（原书第三版）》2.2 节。</description><pubDate>Thu, 09 Oct 2025 11:05:46 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>参数估计的基本方法：频率替换估计、矩估计、极大似然估计</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%B0%E8%AE%A1%E6%B3%95/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%B0%E8%AE%A1%E6%B3%95/</guid><description>参数估计在机器学习中运用非常多（详见 PRML，我记得里面有很大的篇幅去讲如何估计高斯分布）。那么参数估计是解决一个什么样的问题呢？假设我们有一个高斯分布 $N(\mu, \sigma^{2})$，我们并不知道它的 $\mu, \theta$，但是有很多采样得到的数据点 $x_{1},x_{2},\dots ,x_{n…</description><pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 02:46:57 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>如何嵌入 B 站视频</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%B5%8C%E5%85%A5b%E7%AB%99%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%B5%8C%E5%85%A5b%E7%AB%99%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91/</guid><description>教你把视频嵌入到 obsidian 中</description><pubDate>Fri, 10 Oct 2025 14:27:51 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>旋转矩阵、欧拉角、四元数</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%A7%BF%E6%80%81%E6%8F%8F%E8%BF%B0%E6%97%8B%E8%BD%AC%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E6%AC%A7%E6%8B%89%E8%A7%92%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%87%E5%90%91%E9%94%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%85%83%E6%95%B0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E5%A7%BF%E6%80%81%E6%8F%8F%E8%BF%B0%E6%97%8B%E8%BD%AC%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E6%AC%A7%E6%8B%89%E8%A7%92%E4%B8%8E%E4%B8%87%E5%90%91%E9%94%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%85%83%E6%95%B0/</guid><description>[坐标系与位姿变换](/blog/坐标系与位姿变换/) 里说过这一节了。本质上就是 ${}_{B}^AR$，表示从 $B$ 坐标系到 $A$ 坐标系的旋转变换。</description><pubDate>Fri, 10 Oct 2025 09:09:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>容器操作</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 20 Aug 2025 10:55:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>机械臂正运动学 (Forward Kinematics, FK)</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E6%9C%BA%E6%A2%B0%E8%87%82%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%E5%AD%A6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E6%9C%BA%E6%A2%B0%E8%87%82%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%E5%AD%A6/</guid><description>通常把地面 ground 作为 i=0 的杆（link）。坐标系有可能不在实物上，你不能把实物当成抽象。</description><pubDate>Thu, 16 Oct 2025 12:49:19 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>欧拉角的万向锁现象</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E6%AC%A7%E6%8B%89%E8%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%87%E5%90%91%E9%94%81%E7%8E%B0%E8%B1%A1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E6%AC%A7%E6%8B%89%E8%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%87%E5%90%91%E9%94%81%E7%8E%B0%E8%B1%A1/</guid><description>这次我终于搞懂万向锁了！！</description><pubDate>Fri, 10 Oct 2025 16:08:13 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>训练常用命令</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description>在云GPU环境下搞深度学习训练，必会的几个命令</description><pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 10:53:53 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Bayes 估计</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E8%B4%9D%E5%8F%B6%E6%96%AF%E4%BC%B0%E8%AE%A1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E8%B4%9D%E5%8F%B6%E6%96%AF%E4%BC%B0%E8%AE%A1/</guid><description>这章内容叫做*参数估计：点估计*，因此指的是对模型的参数 $\theta$ 的估计。以机器学习为例，我们假设数据分布可以用一个 $\pi(\theta)$ 的模型（比如是一个正态分布模型）去描述，那么如何估计正态分布的参数 $\theta$——即 $\mu$ 和 $\sigma^{2}$ 呢？</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Nov 2025 06:17:16 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>贝叶斯网络</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E8%B4%9D%E5%8F%B6%E6%96%AF%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E8%B4%9D%E5%8F%B6%E6%96%AF%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C/</guid><description>贝叶斯网络是一种**概率图模型**。我觉得没啥讲的，[貝氏網路 - 维基百科，自由的百科全书](https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B2%9D%E6%B0%8F%E7%B6%B2%E8%B7%AF) 看下 wiki 就行。</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Nov 2025 09:42:18 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>轨迹规划</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/</guid><description>[轨迹规划 (Trajectory Plan) | 知乎](https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/445941991)</description><pubDate>Tue, 21 Oct 2025 13:38:30 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>霍夫丁不等式 (Hoeffding&apos;s inequality)，与多臂赌博机 (MAB) 中的上置信界 (UCB) 算法</title><link>https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E9%9C%8D%E5%A4%AB%E4%B8%81%E4%B8%8D%E7%AD%89%E5%BC%8F%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%8A%E7%95%8C%E7%BD%AE%E4%BF%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://niyuta.eu.org/blog/%E9%9C%8D%E5%A4%AB%E4%B8%81%E4%B8%8D%E7%AD%89%E5%BC%8F%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%8A%E7%95%8C%E7%BD%AE%E4%BF%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/</guid><description>[多臂老虎机](https://hrl.boyuai.com/chapter/1/%E5%A4%9A%E8%87%82%E8%80%81%E8%99%8E%E6%9C%BA)</description><pubDate>Fri, 26 Sep 2025 09:33:36 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>